Import "Electrical-power-engineering.lingua"

Power-engineering sources — complete books, courses, methods and evidence (@pe-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering) { r_12EFX00X7ZXGT9MPMJDYRTNY9N
Complete technical books and courses supply sustained reading; precise later assignments support individual methods, designs and physical questions. Each source identifies what is known about version, access, notices and inspection limits. Free reading, an open licence and a catalogue entry are different. All external books, papers, manuals, data, media and software remain references.

**Complete introductory and mathematical books:** [DC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](sources/DC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_4A9FXBXKNPS4JV50QQ3TVPS2GV) · [AC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](sources/AC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_0C4FYP5P0A5GQP13HAD8FTEEWK) · [Introduction to Electric Power Systems — MIT 6.061](sources/Introduction-to-Electric-Power-Systems-MIT.lingua#r_6JR10ZVGMZ7GT4RRK7734JQ7WD) · [Sistemas elétricos de potência — Arlei Bichels](sources/Sistemas-Eletricos-de-Potencia-Bichels.lingua#r_5T4SVBJ6FAPQWJPVNQV4Y6427G) · [Introduction to Applied Linear Algebra — Boyd and Vandenberghe](sources/Introduction-to-Applied-Linear-Algebra-Boyd.lingua#r_3684D74C735KQS61ST3EH0XKZW) · [Feedback Systems — Åström and Murray](sources/Feedback-Systems-Astrom-Murray.lingua#r_7N4SZEXCRGZZFW2EV9X86G7833) · [Convex Optimization — Boyd and Vandenberghe](sources/Convex-Optimization-Boyd-Vandenberghe.lingua#r_54EB992HDGH8YV8BEV5PT5CYHA).

**Machines, conversion, construction and repair:** [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH) · [Power Electronics — MIT 6.334, Spring 2007](sources/Power-Electronics-MIT-6-334.lingua#r_071M46GNC27PPJVTZEQTMEF526) · [Advance Power Electronics — Bhim Singh, IIT Delhi](sources/Advanced-Power-Electronics-Bhim-Singh.lingua#r_4249XQH4D831ATDY73HJHCPRAS) · [High Voltage DC Transmission — S. N. Singh](sources/High-Voltage-DC-Transmission-Singh.lingua#r_26QM8ZB3JZVW1D1TWRY8JXX3B4) · [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30) · [Improving Motor and Drive System Performance — DOE](sources/Improving-Motor-and-Drive-System-Performance-DOE.lingua#r_71MGTGWBE9B62SJ1GS6Y3W8MKR) · [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP).

