Shared field books remain available through [Electromagnetic sources — complete books, courses, methods and research](../../physics/electromagnetism/Sources.lingua#r_6XW0N80NM6WSDWED10N8N7WX3P), including [Electromagnetics Volume 1 — Steven W. Ellingson](../../physics/electromagnetism/sources/Electromagnetics-Volume-1-Ellingson.lingua#r_30KS80JAJY91W0FGZMASQW9DJA), [Electromagnetics Volume 2 — Steven W. Ellingson](../../physics/electromagnetism/sources/Electromagnetics-Volume-2-Ellingson.lingua#r_5P52CZD00XV6MMPFY9RHADT5KJ), [Electromagnetism — David Tong](../../physics/electromagnetism/sources/Electromagnetism-Tong.lingua#r_278NEA0Z85RJZSPXQ8G55E3SR1), [Electromagnetics and Applications — David H. Staelin](../../physics/electromagnetism/sources/Electromagnetics-and-Applications-Staelin.lingua#r_45QC1TW6RXJBJE8Q5H98DZT5AC) and [Electromagnetic Fields and Energy — Haus and Melcher](../../physics/electromagnetism/sources/Electromagnetic-Fields-and-Energy-Haus-Melcher.lingua#r_1VKHEEC14B3VDGBA13T6K4JQNV). [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5) and [Reproducible computational work](../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) supply the existing generic quantitative, measurement and computational methods. [Read electrical power engineering from zero](foundations/Read-power-engineering-from-zero.lingua#r_11GVTDYSY9YANKJJ9FYF53DK7W) and [A full practical and graduate power-engineering programme](study/A-full-practical-and-graduate-power-engineering-programme.lingua#r_762ATXJ9563BT8M3229MP1G1FR) explain the gradual and advanced use of this material. Obtain a complete authorized work before relying on a method that only its catalogue or abstract describes.

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
